CoordIrregular
[<100>:щэ] [>:>] Half

PATTERN OneNine
One | TwoFive | SixNine

PATTERN TwoNine
TwoFive | SixNine

PATTERN OneFive
One | TwoFive

PATTERN TenDeg
Ten | HigherPowers

PATTERN Tens
TensStem[lit] [>:>] TenBy[lit]
TensStem[kub] [>:>] TenBy[kub]
TensStem[malk] [>:>] TenBy[malk]
TensStem[bes] [>:>] TenBy[bes]
TensIrregular

PATTERN Fraction
